00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
with this show
being released on Netflix.

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:07.207 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It sure did.

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:10.243
-You had to do a lot of presser
on the heels of New Year's.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:11.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you exhausted?
-I'm a little bit tired,

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:15.081
but it's unrelated to the press,
which is totally fine.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-It is dog-related.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's dog-related.
-It's dog-related.

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:21.021 size:75% position:38%
He is the famous dad
of Frisbee the dog.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:21.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And some kids,

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, also, Frisbee.
-Yeah.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:24.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I'm sure
you guys have dogs.

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:27.927
So, the other night, I finished
doing some talk shows,

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:28.728 line:92%
early mornings, et cetera --

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
nothing anyone
should feel bad for me about.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's all --
I'm very lucky, et cetera.

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:33.299 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So, I get in bed.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:34.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like,
