00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:38.304
I'm gonna take Moxie the dog out
one last time."

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:39.406 size:75% position:38% line:92%
10:00 -- I'm in bed.

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:43.710
About an hour and a half later,
I hear [growling]

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.344 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I look at her,

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she's, like,
this close to my face,

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:47.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
