"I'm about to have diarrhea."

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:48.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, wow.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know your dog well enough,
or was it that obvious?

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:54.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She was breathing in my face
in a way that was like,

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:57.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You have about 30 seconds..."
-Wow.

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:59.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
"...to get your
'you know what' together,

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:00.994 align:start size:94% position:6%
or mine is going to
get out of my body."

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.
-So...

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:03.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I wish I could say
this is a beautiful --

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:04.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, she's --
-For those --

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:05.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
just for, you know,
frame of reference, there.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ordinarily, I would never...
[ Audience awws ]

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah, that's Moxie.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:11.104
I would never out her as being
something that poops, because...

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:14.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. And I'm assuming
you wouldn't make out with her

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
on diarrhea night.
-No, no.

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:17.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, almost.
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:18.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was --
She was so close to me.

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:21.214
It's as if that's what
she was trying to do, honestly.

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:21.681 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:24.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, we go downstairs.
Retainer's out.

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:25.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
Clothes over my...
-Yeah.

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:27.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, it's relevant.
-Yeah.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We're all, like,
just pretending

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:30.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
we don't wear, like,
a mouth guard.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:34.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, yeah,
I put clothes over the PJs,

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:35.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause don't need
to horrify everyone.

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:37.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the retainer's out,
and I say hi.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:38.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have a doorman.
I said hi to him.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:41.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
I take Moxie out.
She does her business.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:42.168 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Um.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was the beginning
of a very, very long night.

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
-I go back upstairs.

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:49.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
I dry off.
I get other clothes off.

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
Retainer's back in, obviously.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:52.345 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-And get back in bed.

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:53.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
About an hour later...
[growling]

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.348 size:81% position:41% line:92%
She wakes me up again.

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:58.451
So, every hour on the hour,
we went back downstairs.

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:01.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
By 4:00 a.m.,
I'm on my bed weeping...

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:02.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-...uncontrollably.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:03.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Audience awws ]
-I'm just so tired.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, I'm being tortured
by tiny chunks of sleep.

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:08.828
And then, at some point, she --
I was, like, delirious.

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:10.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she --
It's like 4:30 in the morning.

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:12.232 size:78% position:39%
She's having diarrhea
over a subway grate.

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:14.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm thinking,
"What's below a subway grate?"

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:15.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:18.304
-Because, in my mind, they're in
the middle of the tracks.

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:20.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I also thought there was,
like, a 20% chance

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:22.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was gonna hear
a muffled, like, "Hey!"

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:24.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, I made a mental note
to check,

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:27.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
next time
I'm in the subway, like,

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:29.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
what's directly
under the subway grate.

00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:31.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Yeah.
-But, yeah, so then --

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:34.854
I just have so much respect
for people with actual babies

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:35.955 line:92%
because this is what it's like.

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're up constantly.
-Yeah.

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:39.592 size:84% position:42%
-And I had -- your wife
gives birth in lobbies.

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:40.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, she does.
-And, you know,

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.795 align:start size:94% position:6%
fights human trafficking.
-Famously, yeah.

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:44.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, famously gives birth
in lobbies,

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:46.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, for general people,
or just you guys.

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:46.900 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:48.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Fights human trafficking,
et cetera.

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:51.504
My dog had diarrhea for one
night, and it nearly killed me.

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:52.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.272 --> 00:02:53.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
I will let you know --
and this is good --

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:56.543 size:75% position:38%
the biggest ass ache
in my life right now

00:02:56.543 --> 00:02:57.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
is still my dog.
-Oh!

00:02:57.577 --> 00:02:59.379 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, even with children
and everything --

00:02:59.379 --> 00:03:01.214
-Well, 'cause I happen to know,
Frisbee is so small that,

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:03.983
on a couple of occasions,
Frisbee has been misplaced.

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:06.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
Frisbee will misplace herself.

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:08.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
Frisbee
will sometimes have diarrhea,

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:10.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she's so small that,
like, noise you made, the...

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:11.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Growling ]
-Yeah.

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:13.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You don't hear that. Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:15.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just, like, wake up,
and you were like,

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:18.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You had diarrhea last night."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:21.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want to ask, you do not --
you do not have a child,

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:22.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you --
-I don't have a child.

00:03:22.969 --> 00:03:24.704
-You're pregnant in this season
of "Lemony Snicket."

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:26.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I am, it was a -- yeah.
-And --

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:27.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have
a wonderful prosthetic belly.

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:30.410
-It was a prosthetic.
Well, let me explain this photo.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I mean, I don't know

00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:33.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
if it requires an explanation,
but...

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.216 size:81% position:41%
So, it's prosthetic,
meaning it's not real.

00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:37.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-And it is --

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:38.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's very skin-like, though,
and it looks real.

00:03:38.952 --> 00:03:40.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
People have thought
I was really pregnant on set.

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was doing all these stunts.
I was flying.

00:03:42.589 --> 00:03:44.991 size:84% position:42%
I was jumping into ice,
jumping out of ice --

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:45.658 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
all kinds of stuff.

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:48.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
And everyone was like, "Ohh,
what kind of 7-month-mom

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:50.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
is doing this stuff?"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:50.930 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Anyway, it was fake.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
And people would bump into me
and into it

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:54.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
and say,
"Oh, my God, I'm sorry."

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:56.069
And I was like,
"I can't feel it -- it's fine."

00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:57.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they just
would give me this look of,

00:03:57.804 --> 00:04:00.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, "Why can't you feel
your stomach?"

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:01.074 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:03.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, anyway,
because I can't feel it,

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:05.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
I constantly
left my shirt up like that.

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:08.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know why.
But so, this is just --

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:11.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
this is just me in my trailer
going over my lines,

00:04:11.184 --> 00:04:12.185 line:92%
and my sister took this photo

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:14.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
because that's just -- that's,
like, how I spent my time,

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:18.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
