like, just...

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:20.126 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
...living my life.

00:04:20.126 --> 00:04:22.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The funny thing is,
I think that's the dream

00:04:22.328 --> 00:04:24.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
