is to do that.

00:04:24.364 --> 00:04:25.098 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Yes, Just let it out.

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:26.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And yet, you just were like,
"I'm gonna do it."

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:29.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, here's a new idea --
tell people it's a prosthetic.

00:04:29.535 --> 00:04:31.037
-Yeah.
-You can get away with anything.

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:33.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, exactly, it's not real.
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:35.575
-And then, they'll -- yeah,
I think that's a good idea.

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:38.444
Did you ever think about wearing
it on the subway to get a seat?

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:39.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you ever?
Be honest.

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:40.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I never did,
'cause it's very heavy.

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:41.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And I loved being able

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:42.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
to take it off
at the end of the night.

00:04:42.815 --> 00:04:44.917
And I was like -- my pregnant
friends would give anything

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:46.419
to be able to take it off
at the end of the night.

00:04:46.419 --> 00:04:47.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, exactly.

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:48.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
That would be a huge --
That's the thing --

00:04:48.755 --> 00:04:49.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's the app
you should invent.

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:52.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's -- That's horrifying.
-[ Laughing ] How...

